experiment: chase
  instrument        chase   trial seed 0000000001352b83   1214 trials
                    another probe is another trial sequence: its numbers
                    are not comparable with these (~0.05 at 300 trials)
  question          three ways of asking for more distance have now failed,
                    and all three failed the SAME way: the target stopped
                    being straddled. This is the target that cannot.
  the rule          targets at the 20th and 80th percentiles of the
                    creature's OWN recent F1, over 200 scored trials,
                    recomputed every 50. It already reaches each a fifth of
                    the time, and the quantiles follow it outward, so the
                    staircase climbs itself with no rate to tune.
  the precedent     this is the songbird rule: the white-noise threshold is
                    set from the BIRD'S pitch distribution, not an absolute
                    pitch. `staircase` avoided the closed loop on purity
                    grounds and that purity is what broke it.
  not an oracle     it reads the creature's own OUTPUT distribution, which
                    is what the experimenter measures -- not a hidden
                    variable and not the answer.
  what a null means unambiguous this time. A target always straddled,
                    always answerable and free to climb is the strongest
                    form of the protocol hypothesis there is. If the voice
                    still stops near 0.28, the protocol account is exhausted
                    and the ceiling is the exponent. 36 seeds.

